{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Settings of gold they shall be.</b> The rows <b>in their fullness</b> — surrounded by gold settings at a depth of measure that would be filled by the thickness of the stone. This is the sense of בְּמִלּוּאֹתָם: the depth of the settings is to the measure of the filling, that is, the thickness of the stones — no less and no more."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:11.939789942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}